            "text": "I'm Dr. Renata Vela. After fifteen years researching responsible AI at MIT and Oxford, I've delivered keynotes at 184 conferences across 27 countries. My talks are not slide-deck recitations of last year's headlines — they are field reports from inside the work, calibrated to your audience, timed to the minute. The room earns the standing ovation; I just bring the material that makes it possible."
